# Lumenhold Academy — 简体中文 (zh-CN) translation of content/world/facts/lyra.grim
# Maintained by `node tools/grim.js i18n zh-CN`. Translate the text after "="; keep {tokens}.
# "# en:" shows the English source. [hash] marks the English version a line was translated from;
# lines marked STALE need updating — after fixing the text, delete the [hash] and re-run the tool.


@fact lyra.prodigy
# en: The pyromancy prodigy of House Vaneshade. Everyone knows the name, and she makes sure of it.
text [7f3f8a] = 凡妮希德家族的火焰术天才。人人都知道这个名字，她也确保人人都知道。

@fact lyra.toast
# en: She can incinerate a target at forty paces. She cannot make toast.
text [8eef62] = 她能在四十步外把靶子烧成灰。她不会烤面包片。

@fact lyra.mother
# en: Her mother has never once told her "well done".
text [a56886] = 她的母亲从没对她说过一句“做得好”。
# en: Become good friends with her.
hint [357f63] = 和她成为好朋友。

@fact lyra.second_place
# en: She came second in the Winter Trials once. Her mother wrote to ask who beat her.
text [c586c0] = 她在冬季试炼中得过一次第二名。她母亲写信来问是谁赢了她。

@fact lyra.burnout
# en: She studies until she collapses, and begs you not to let her mother find out.
text [8e25bd] = 她会一直学到昏过去，还求你别让她母亲知道。

@fact lyra.rival
# en: You are the only person here who makes her better. She hates it. She doesn't want it to stop.
text [049900] = 你是这里唯一能让她变得更好的人。她恨这一点。她不想让它停下。
# en: Become her rival.
hint [7d573f] = 成为她的对手。

@fact lyra.inheritance
# en: Her mother threatened her inheritance over you. She set the letter on fire.
text [b8b62f] = 她母亲为了你，拿她的继承权来威胁她。她把那封信烧了。
# en: Become her partner.
hint [97e375] = 成为她的恋人。

@fact lyra.wildfire
# en: Vaneshades sleep exactly eight hours; she can't sleep. Her grandmother's spell, Wildfire, was only for people she trusted, and Lyra has never had anyone to teach it to.
text [981a53] = 凡妮希德家的人睡足整整八个小时；她却睡不着。她祖母的咒语“野火”只传给信得过的人，而莱拉从来没有可以传授的人。
# en: Become her closest friend.
hint [87f256] = 成为她最亲密的朋友。

@fact lyra.flourish
# en: Her family has opened its duels with the same ribbon-of-flame flourish for two hundred years. Teaching it outside the family is not done.
text [4802ff] = 两百年来，她家决斗开场都用同一个火焰缎带起手式。把它教给外人，是不合规矩的。

@fact lyra.camp_bed
# en: At Vaneshade House she sleeps on a camp bed in the scorched practice room. Her real bedroom, downstairs, is kept for visitors to see.
text [c062bb] = 在凡妮希德府，她睡在烧焦的练习室里的一张行军床上。她真正的卧室在楼下，是留给客人看的。
# en: Spend a break in the capital, and call at Vaneshade House.
hint [3275c8] = 假期去王都，登门拜访凡妮希德府。

@fact lyra.cook
# en: Mrs Callow, the cook at Vaneshade House, has made her toast every morning she has ever spent at home. Lyra has written to her every week since she went away to school.
text [897d5d] = 卡洛太太是凡妮希德府的厨娘，莱拉每一个在家的早上，吐司都是她做的。莱拉离家上学后，每周都给她写信。
# en: Call at Vaneshade House once you are friends.
hint [7ad5da] = 成为朋友后去凡妮希德府。

@fact lyra.grandmother
# en: Her grandmother is the only Vaneshade in the gallery who is smiling. She lit candles by telling them bad jokes: fire, she said, likes to be surprised.
text [c7765e] = 她祖母是长廊里唯一在笑的凡妮希德。祖母靠讲烂笑话点蜡烛：她说，火喜欢被吓一跳。
# en: Keep calling at Vaneshade House as you grow closer.
hint [c0137e] = 随着你们越走越近，常去凡妮希德府。
